"entity": {
"name": "Harley-Davidson, Inc.",
"description": "Harley-Davidson, Inc. is engaged in the manufacture and sale of custom, cruiser, and touring motorcycles. It operates through the following segments: Harley-Davidson Motor Company, LiveWire, and Harley-Davidson Financial Services. The LiveWire segment is an all-electric motorcycle brand. The Harley-Davidson Financial Services segment engages in the business of financing and servicing wholesale inventory receivables and retail consumer loans, primarily for the purchase of Harley-Davidson and LiveWire motorcycles. The company was founded in 1903 and is headquartered in Milwaukee, WI.",
